# Post-Response App Link

After finishing **every** Agent-mode request (UI change, fix, feature, or config), end the reply with the current local entry URL the user can open.

## Rules
- Always include a clickable absolute URL (e.g. `http://localhost:3000/`).
- Prefer the **most relevant route** for what just changed (home, lesson, settings, etc.).
- If the route is unknown, default to the app home URL.
- Read the active `npm run dev` terminal when needed to confirm host/port; do not invent a dead port.
- Keep this as a short final line — do not bury it mid-answer.

## Example endings
- `افتح: http://localhost:3000/`
- `افتح التمرين: http://localhost:3000/lesson/1`
- `افتح الإعدادات: http://localhost:3000/settings`
